{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Day With Vanessa", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Art Exhibit", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Subject and Object Relative Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to clarify which person or thing you are talking about, you use a relative clause.<br/><br/>You can begin a relative clause with <span class=\"italic\">who</span> for people, <span class=\"italic\">which</span> for things or <span class=\"italic\">that</span> for either people or things.<br/><br/>In spoken English you usually use <span class=\"italic\">that</span>, rather than <span class=\"italic\">which</span> or <span class=\"italic\">who</span>.<br/><br/>You put the relative clause immediately after the noun it talks about.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A subject relative clause describes the subject of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">The man <span class=\"strong\">who/that</span> called wanted to speak to Tom.</span><br/>Which man? The man who called.<br/>The clause <span class=\"italic\">who called</span> immediately follows <span class=\"italic\">man</span> - the noun it describes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An object relative clause describes the object of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">The book <span class=\"strong\">which/that</span> I lent you was my father's.</span><br/>Which book? The book I lent you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Relative Connector</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Type of Relative Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ai Wei Wei is an artist who is also considered to be an activist. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who is considered to be an activist\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">This is the sign which represents me, no?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which represents me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There are certain attributes that people associate with each sign.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" that people associate with each sign\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future - If, When, Before and After", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the words If, When, Before and After in time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If/When/Before/After + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + will/be going to + Simple Present tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before</span> means at an earlier time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">After</span> means at a later time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Before I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm.<br/>After I set my alarm, I'm going to go to sleep.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ... ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">If I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm. (I'm not sure that I'll go to sleep.)</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> means at the time of doing something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">When I go to bed, I'll set my alarm.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " I'll do some research about it when I get home.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Before you do that, let's try to guess! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If they have a miniature horse sculpture in the gift shop, I'm going to buy it! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "After this, are we going to go for lunch? ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bronze", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a yellowish-brown metal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The sculptures are made of bronze.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about art.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "zodiac", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a repeating cycle of 12 years, with each year being represented by an animal and its attributes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a bronze sculpture for each animal of the zodiac. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dynasty", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a line of rulers of a country", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Qing dynasty of China was from 1644-1912.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "attribute", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feature", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are certain attributes that are associated with each sign.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dramatic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "impressive; spectacular", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love his use of bronze ... It has such a dramatic tone to it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vibrant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "lively; colorful; bright", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The colors are so vibrant!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the general character or attitude of a place, person or thing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The statues have a dramatic tone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to sparkle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to shine brightly with flashes of light", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They seem to sparkle under the light!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "miniature", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very small", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If they have a miniature horse sculpture in the gift shop, I'm going to buy it! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine that you can travel to another city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a plan for the weekend. What will you do first?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Add some details about the places and people you will see.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your plan with a partner or friend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about connected events in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express complex statements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about feelings and impressions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         So, this exhibit is called \u201cCircle of Animals/Zodiac Heads: Gold\u201d. Isn't it just breathtaking?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:             Wow! There is a bronze sculpture for each animal of the zodiac. They are so detailed. It says here that they are inspired by sculptures from the Qing dynasty.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         Ai Wei Wei is an artist who is also considered to be an activist. His art is a commentary about what is going on in China and other parts of the world."}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:             So, I was born in 1990. This is the sign which represents me, no?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         The year of the horse? I think so. There are certain attributes that people associate with each sign, you know.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:             Oh? I wonder what my attributes are. I'll do some research about it when I get home.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         Before you do that, let's try to guess! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:             I don't know about that ... The colors are so vibrant! They seem to sparkle under the light!"}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "55000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         I love his use of bronze \u2026 It has such a dramatic tone to it.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:             If they have a miniature horse sculpture in the gift shop, I'm going to buy it! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         After this, are we going to go for lunch? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:             Yes, I made reservations."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about feelings and impressions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express complex statements using words like <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">that</span> or <span class=\"italic\">which</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about connected events in the future using <span class=\"italic\">if</span>, <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">before </span>or <span class=\"italic\">after</span>. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever heard of the Chinese zodiac?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "If you could see any art exhibition, past or present, which artist would you want to see? Why? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "